    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/9bc35a0414d567dfb84a70c217528f01.avif?t=1730944874\" width=616 height=84 /></span><br>Use your telekinetic powers to solve the puzzles of the Sacred Lands and uncover the source of the evil threatening them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/01078e7741b2b1e3d0adf0ca2a967f53.poster.avif?t=1730944874\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/01078e7741b2b1e3d0adf0ca2a967f53.webm?t=1730944874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/01078e7741b2b1e3d0adf0ca2a967f53.mp4?t=1730944874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/45459b8aea983db4de5e4b629ee93e50.poster.avif?t=1730944874\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/45459b8aea983db4de5e4b629ee93e50.webm?t=1730944874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/45459b8aea983db4de5e4b629ee93e50.mp4?t=1730944874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Telekinetic powers</strong>: Solve puzzles by absorbing and dropping objects from a distance and through walls, uncover hidden platforms, activate mechanisms remotely, detonate explosives, and more.<br></li><li><strong>Special elements</strong>: Manipulate objects and enemies, overcome obstacles that nullify your powers, progress through areas that slow you down, navigate through zones with altered gravity, and more.<br></li><li><strong>Boss fights</strong>: Defeat corrupted spirits through a challenge that is a puzzle in itself, using your wit to figure out how to overcome them.<br></li><li><strong>Narrative</strong>: Discover the looming threat over the Sacred Lands and its true essence, delve into the history of the spirit that accompanies you, and grasp your role in destiny.<br></li><li><strong>Platforming and Skill</strong>: Navigate through zones filled with obstacles and traps by combining your powers with your intelligence and agility.</li></ul><br><i>Those chosen to be guardians of the Sacred Lands have preserved the balance for centuries, being relieved at the end of their lives. The great day has come for young Aiden, but he will soon discover that, during his watch, things will be different.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/transformation.gif?t=1730944874\" width=616 height=380 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/9cefd6f0dc505465316a48448692e68c.avif?t=1730944874\" width=616 height=84 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/9bc35a0414d567dfb84a70c217528f01.avif?t=1730944874\" width=616 height=84 /></span><br>Use your telekinetic powers to solve the puzzles of the Sacred Lands and uncover the source of the evil threatening them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/01078e7741b2b1e3d0adf0ca2a967f53.poster.avif?t=1730944874\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/01078e7741b2b1e3d0adf0ca2a967f53.webm?t=1730944874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/01078e7741b2b1e3d0adf0ca2a967f53.mp4?t=1730944874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/45459b8aea983db4de5e4b629ee93e50.poster.avif?t=1730944874\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/45459b8aea983db4de5e4b629ee93e50.webm?t=1730944874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/45459b8aea983db4de5e4b629ee93e50.mp4?t=1730944874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Telekinetic powers</strong>: Solve puzzles by absorbing and dropping objects from a distance and through walls, uncover hidden platforms, activate mechanisms remotely, detonate explosives, and more.<br></li><li><strong>Special elements</strong>: Manipulate objects and enemies, overcome obstacles that nullify your powers, progress through areas that slow you down, navigate through zones with altered gravity, and more.<br></li><li><strong>Boss fights</strong>: Defeat corrupted spirits through a challenge that is a puzzle in itself, using your wit to figure out how to overcome them.<br></li><li><strong>Narrative</strong>: Discover the looming threat over the Sacred Lands and its true essence, delve into the history of the spirit that accompanies you, and grasp your role in destiny.<br></li><li><strong>Platforming and Skill</strong>: Navigate through zones filled with obstacles and traps by combining your powers with your intelligence and agility.</li></ul><br><i>Those chosen to be guardians of the Sacred Lands have preserved the balance for centuries, being relieved at the end of their lives. The great day has come for young Aiden, but he will soon discover that, during his watch, things will be different.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/transformation.gif?t=1730944874\" width=616 height=380 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935570/extras/9cefd6f0dc505465316a48448692e68c.avif?t=1730944874\" width=616 height=84 /></span>",
